<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8237] Ignite blocks on SecurityException in exchange-worker due to unauthorised on-heap cache configuration </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8237</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ignite blocks on SecurityException in exchange-worker due to unauthorised on-heap cache configuration. Consider moving IGNITE_DISABLE_ONHEAP_CACHE system property check to a more appropriate place to avoid blocking Ignite.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
